  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Is this the, um, the Thai place on Thames Street? For the lunch special?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, ma'am, I'm sorry. This is the City Clerk's office at Newport City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall. Oh. Okay, City Hall. I dialed wrong, then. I am so sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. It happens. You might look the restaurant up online, or check the number in a phone book or on their menu. I can't look it up from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, online, I will do that. I was going to get vegetables first, at the farm stand in Middletown, but it is closed for the season. So I thought, lunch instead. Then I dial wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that's a shame about the stand. They usually close up for the winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:21:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So, I check the number again, and I look online. Thank you, thank you. And I am sorry again for bothering you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:22:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:22:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
